    topBandRatio = 7/18` (`recomposed_shift_exact`, cutPi-free). ARCH-A OVER-COUNTS the top-band census
    by exactly the `s` slice the Z1 negative isospin self-census removes. -/
theorem architecture_shift_exact :
    recombArch 0 [(chargeTraceDepth, topBandRatio)]
        - recombArch projectedS [(chargeTraceDepth, topBandRatio)]
      = bandScreen projectedS topBandRatio := by
  rw [recombArch_zero_eq_additive, recombArch_projectedS_eq_recomposed]
  exact recomposed_shift_exact

/-- ★★ THE ARCHITECTURES GENUINELY DIFFER AT THE TOP BAND: `recombArch 0 [(_,top)] ≠ recombArch
    projectedS [(_,top)]`. The shift is the nonzero Z1 anti-screening `7/18`, so the audit
    discriminates a real structural difference, not a relabelling. -/
