    projectedS_admissible.2 hμ hμM

/-- ★★ THE TWO MIXING READINGS ARE GENUINELY DISTINCT: at a running scale (`0 < κ`, `0 < μ < M`, and
    the isospin coupling nonzero at the switch-off depth) ARCH-A's frozen `3/8` is NOT ARCH-B's
